laneflow v0.1
direction LR

# Example 02 — Decision gateway in a single lane.
# Teaches: gateway shape, labeled arrows, multiple paths to end event.

lane Sales "Sales"

Sales: start    (Order received)
Sales: check    [Check availability]
Sales: decide   <Available?>
Sales: confirm  [Confirm order]
Sales: reject   [Send rejection notice]
Sales: done     ((Process complete))

start --> check --> decide
decide -- yes --> confirm --> done
decide -- no  --> reject  --> done
